OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,6,Fvariable cloud and some hazy sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Light winds and turning a
OL,8,Flittle warmer, especially over inland
OL,9,Fand western areas.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry bright evening then a
OL,12,Fdry night with some clear spells,
OL,13,Fthough some patchy low cloud in the
OL,14,Feast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,17,Fsome good sunny spells. Becoming very
OL,18,Fwarm or hot, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
